error[E8009]  c/c.canon:6:33
  open of emit cpp needs mode types, not baked

error[E8009]  d/d.canon:6:45
  open of emit cpp needs mode types, not data

error[E8009]  t/t.canon:6:35
  open of emit ts needs mode types, not baked

error[E8009]  u/u.canon:6:51
  open of emit ts needs mode types, not embedded

